WEBVTT

00:11:52.964 --> 00:12:00.004
na kutangaza kwamba tunaweza
kuisha ndoa za watoto katika kizazi kimoja.

00:12:00.677 --> 00:12:02.860
Sasa ni wakati

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:07.294
ambapo msichana na msichana,
na millioni za wasichana duniani,

00:12:07.294 --> 00:12:09.895
wataweza kusema,

00:12:09.895 --> 00:12:13.099
"Nitolewa ninapotaka."

00:12:13.099 --> 00:12:16.144
(Makofi)

00:12:23.284 --> 00:12:25.219
Asante. (Makofi)